# "It's a Spirit in addition to its other types": the word is the Witness's own text (CR 612). Bot1 casts the Witness
# on its own Hired Blade (killed by its own Lightning Bolt) and, in response, Artificial Evolution changes the spell's
# text, Spirit to Elf (CR 612.1). The Blade returns with its flying counter as a Human Assassin Elf, not a Spirit.

